{"version":1,"content":"<p>凌晨2時許，深水埗元州街68至70號一幢唐樓後樓梯突然起火冒出濃煙，消防接報趕至現場開喉撲救，約15分鐘後將火救熄。</p><p>消防經調查相信梯間雜物起火，初步無可疑。</p><p>事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T02:39:12.429931+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T02:07:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T20:37:37.184588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T02:37:38.289139+00:00","content_hash":"0813cd2dc4c7fe5d8d192416df593f7d6fa3370d64e628e314212913ce4c0ad3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}